    "detailed_description": "All About The High Score is all about the high score, and is a collection of free arcade games, the first game being <strong>Jumpdot</strong>.<br><br>- achievements for high scores<br>- leaderboards (what would an arcade game be without them?)<br>- one game now, but many more coming later<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jumpdot</h2><br>The first free game is called Jumpdot, and is a single-button game where you have to quickly jump from one dot to another higher up on the screen. Be quick, as the screen is constantly scrolling down. And be nimble, as there are many paddles trying to block your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682540/extras/fd65598ebb76328637286c48b4f8f0dd.poster.avif?t=1699618747\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682540/extras/fd65598ebb76328637286c48b4f8f0dd.webm?t=1699618747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
